---
title:    "A Modular and Generic Analysis Server System for Functional Logic Programs"
citation: "(PEPM 2014)"
url:      "https://www.michaelhanus.de/papers/PEPM14.html"
date:     2014-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper presents the ideas and implementation of the
[program analysis framework CASS](/tools/cass "Curry Analysis Server System").
The implementation is available in the
[Curry package cass](https://cpm.curry-lang.org/pkgs/cass.html).
